OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FReporter Katie Cole met Abbie
OL,7,FDevanney's sister Amy, who hopes the
OL,8,Ffootage shows people the impact
OL,9,F"showing off" behind the wheel can
OL,10,Fhave.
OL,12,FThe sister of a County Durham teenager
OL,13,Fkilled by a speeding driver on her
OL,14,F18th birthday says she hopes lives
OL,15,Fwill be saved as footage from the
OL,16,Fnight she died is released by police.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FAbbie Devanney was a passenger in a
OL,7,Fcar which crashed on a country lane
OL,8,Fnear Consett in October 2023. Three
OL,9,Fother teenage passengers were
OL,10,Fseriously injured.
OL,12,FDurham Constabulary were able to use
OL,13,Flocation data from mobile phones in
OL,14,Fthe car to show the driver, then 17-
OL,15,Fyear-old Charlie Whittaker, had been
OL,16,Ftravelling at more than 70mph on the
OL,17,Funlit 60mph road just before the smash.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FWhittaker was jailed for five years
OL,7,Fand four months in April last year
OL,8,Fafter admitting causing death and
OL,9,Fserious injury by dangerous driving.
OL,11,FPolice have released footage from that
OL,12,Fnight, including videos filmed by a
OL,13,Fpassenger in the car showing it
OL,14,Fspeeding along dark roads with loud
OL,15,Fmusic playing, and girls screaming in
OL,16,Fthe back of the car.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FBodycam footage from the aftermath of
OL,7,Fthe crash captures officers
OL,8,Fidentifying Abbie as well as
OL,9,FWhittaker, who can be heard saying
OL,10,F"this is my worst nightmare" from the
OL,11,Fback of a police car.
OL,13,FIt has been released with the consent
OL,14,Fof all families involved.
OL,16,FAmy Devanney, now 18 herself, was 15
OL,17,Fat the time of her sister's death and
OL,18,Fhas told ITV News Tyne Tees she hopes
OL,19,Fthe footage shows people the impact
OL,20,F"showing off" behind the wheel can
OL,21,Fhave.
OL,26,@rD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FShe said: "I would never assume that
OL,7,Fsomething like this would happen to
OL,8,Fme. People are ignorant until this
OL,9,Fhappens to them and I wouldn't wish
OL,10,Fthis on anybody but I do want people
OL,11,Fto want to see what it's like.
OL,13,F"It's not just the person who's passed
OL,14,Faway or the driver, it's their
OL,15,Ffamilies, the people who have worked
OL,16,Fwith the case - I think it affects so
OL,17,Fmany people and I think people need to
OL,18,Fsee that."
OL,26,@nD@KOUzD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FAbbie had been a backseat passenger in
OL,7,Fthe car along with three other
OL,8,Fteenagers getting a lift with
OL,9,FWhittaker from Consett to Newcastle to
OL,10,Fcelebrate her 18th birthday.
OL,12,FWhittaker had taken a detour home to
OL,13,Fpick up a jacket when the crash
OL,14,Fhappened on Brooms Lane, in Consett.
OL,16,FTravelling at speeds of more than
OL,17,F70mph his car went through a puddle
OL,18,Fand crashed into a tree.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FWhittaker's mother, who he had called
OL,7,Ffollowing the crash, was at the scene
OL,8,Fas police arrived.
OL,10,FShe can be seen on the footage telling
OL,11,Fofficers: "It's terrible, my son has
OL,12,Fcrashed his car. There's five of them
OL,13,Fin. I told him so many times."
OL,15,FWhittaker, who was not injured, is
OL,16,Fheard on the police footage talking to
OL,17,Fan officer who tells him they will get
OL,18,Fhim checked over.
OL,26,@sD@KOUuD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FHe replies: "That's the least of my
OL,7,Fworries right now. I just feel like
OL,8,Fit's always the one who is to blame is
OL,9,Falways the one who is alright."
OL,11,FFootage also shows a conversation
OL,12,Fbetween officers about Abbie's family
OL,13,Freceiving an alert to their phones
OL,14,Ftelling them Abbie's phone had been
OL,15,Finvolved in a crash.
OL,17,FAbbie's father had called police to
OL,18,Fask what had happened and a short time
OL,19,Flater officers arrived at the family
OL,20,Fhome.
OL,26,@nD@MOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FAmy, who just hours earlier had taken
OL,7,Fa photograph with her sister as she
OL,8,Fcurled her hair, said she would never
OL,9,Fforget hearing her mum scream when
OL,10,Fpolice came to their home.
OL,12,F"I was like, what was wrong and she
OL,13,Fjust couldn't get any words out and
OL,14,Fshe was just saying 'Abbie', 'Abbie'
OL,15,Fand then I just kind of had to assume
OL,16,Fthat something had happened because no
OL,17,Fone was telling me," she added.
OL,26,@tD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G9/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,F"I was panicking, I was so shocked. I
OL,7,Fwas saying, no, I just remember saying
OL,8,Fno, I just didn't want to believe it
OL,9,Fat all when it first happened. That
OL,10,Fmemory will stay with me forever."
OL,12,FDetective Sergeant Michael Hogg said
OL,13,Fthe crash had a huge impact on his
OL,14,Fcolleagues who were there that night.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G10/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,F"The last thing you ever want to do is
OL,7,Fto go into somebody's home, especially
OL,8,Fwhen it's your little girl's 18th
OL,9,Fbirthday and we're celebrating the
OL,10,Flife of that particular person and
OL,11,Fthen you'll have to go into that home
OL,12,Fand tell them that life is no more,"
OL,13,Fhe explained.
OL,15,F"I can't even begin to to imagine what
OL,16,Fthat feels like and I hope I never do.
OL,17,FIt's soul destroying."
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FCharlie Whittaker, who had only held
OL,7,Fhis driving licence for six months,
OL,8,Fwas charged with causing death and
OL,9,Fserious injury by driving.
OL,11,FPolice found that Whittaker had
OL,12,Fremoved the tracker device installed
OL,13,Fas part of his insurance days before
OL,14,Fthe crash and they found more than 20
OL,15,Fvideos on his phone that showed him
OL,16,Fdriving recklessly, including speeding
OL,17,Fand carrying out dangerous overtakes.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FDetective Constable Natalie Horner
OL,7,Fsaid the videos showed "he liked
OL,8,Fspeed, he liked cars" and described
OL,9,Fhis driving as "atrocious".
OL,11,FDurham Constabulary have released a
OL,12,Fshort film using footage from that
OL,13,Fnight in a bid to save lives and
OL,14,Fdemonstrate the realities of what can
OL,15,Fhappen when drivers show off.
OL,26,@oD@XOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FDet Con Horner told ITV Tyne Tees: "We
OL,7,Fcould only use this footage to try and
OL,8,Fmake a difference, whether that be
OL,9,Fshowing it to young people within
OL,10,Fschools, in education set ups, whether
OL,11,Fparents want to sit down and show
OL,12,Ftheir children when they get the
OL,13,Fdriving license and more importantly,
OL,14,Fafter they've passed the test.
OL,16,F"Nobody drives like this during the
OL,17,Fdriving test - 24 hours later, people
OL,18,Fthink they're invincible."
OL,26,@nD@dOUzD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FShe also described the devastation in
OL,7,Fthe face of Whittaker during police
OL,8,Finterviews.
OL,10,F"There is some footage where I get a
OL,11,Flittle bit emotional across the table
OL,12,Fbecause he's upset, because I don't
OL,13,Fthink any of us take any satisfaction
OL,14,Fthat across the table is a young
OL,15,Fperson knowing that they've killed
OL,16,Fsomebody and I know at that point
OL,17,Fhe'll end up in jail," she added.
OL,26,@rD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39316
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAmy said so many lives have been
OL,12,Fruined by that night and she would
OL,13,Falways be angry at Whittaker.
OL,15,F"I am angry at him but as I'm getting
OL,16,Folder I can see that he's also ruined
OL,17,Fhis life," she added. "The huge ripple
OL,18,Feffect that this whole thing has had,
OL,19,Flike his parents, he didn't go out
OL,20,Fthat night with that intention.
OL,26,@wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39317
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,F"I think I can separate his stupid
OL,7,Factions from him as a person."
OL,9,FAmy, who starts university in
OL,10,FSeptember, said it is the little
OL,11,Fthings that she misses most about her
OL,12,Fbig sister who she said was "so funny"
OL,13,Fand "kind".
OL,15,F"She was hilarious. She just always
OL,16,Fliked to make people laugh.
OL,26,@oD@^O]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39318
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785939499
OL,3,CSister of teen killed in crash on 18th
OL,4,Cbirthday hopes footage will save lives
OL,6,F"I think it's the little things you
OL,7,Ftake for granted. Like she used to
OL,8,Falways wind me up and steal my clothes
OL,9,Fand I would give anything for her to
OL,10,Fcome in and steal my clothes or start
OL,11,Fan argument. It's those little things
OL,12,Fthat you miss a lot."
OL,26,@tD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}       G18/18
